WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.800
Second Generation Operation

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Turn on the device, connect the phone,
and set the reaction parameters.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Place the sample tube in the high-temperature lysis well
at the front of the device.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.500
90°C — 10 minutes later

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Manually add the lysed sample to the RPA–CRISPR/Cas12a

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
reaction mixture and prepare the reaction tube.

7
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Place the reaction tube in the rotating reaction chamber
and start the reaction.

8
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.000
43°C — 30 minutes later

9
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.133
Start image acquisition in the app, analyze the fluorescence signal,
and view the result.

